      "sourceTextSha256": "6dd4655a321712dcaa5cb6f730efc51e3bfcc8fbb956a2f6a6bcf16216515cc6",
      "text": "Your last full day is packed with great moments. In the morning we go to Nieuw Amsterdam to look for the Great Horned Owl and beautiful shorebirds along the water. After a midday rest, we visit Cultuurtuin where flycatchers dart through the trees and the Spectacled Owl watches quietly from the branches. A beautiful end to an unforgettable trip.\n\nTransfer, guide and hotel Peperpot included.",
